            "review_title": "Review at Banh Xeo Mien Trung",
            "review_text": "Tham N\n8 contributions\n0\nTerrible\nDec 2015 • Family\nWorst I've had. Pancakes were pre-made and then re-fried upon our order. Came out in a pool of oil. We ordered 3 plates of pancakes and 1 nem nuong. The nêm nướng was also average and very tiny - bite size portion on a chopstick. You get about 8-10 sticks for $VDN50K which is overpriced for this area. Overall we paid $VND194k. Tasteless and overpriced. Would not recommend.\nA tip for visiting Da Nang - always carry small change. We took taxi which costs $VND75k, gave the driver $100k. He reached in his pocket and pulled out his business card, nodded and went on his way. I'm happy to tip but only when I want to and on my terms!\nRead more\nWritten December 13, 2015",
            "rating": 5.0,
